      "finding": "After destination allocation success, loads xsave_size at 0xfffffffffe9402c8 into eax, sign-extends to rdx and calls memcpy at 0xfffffffffe872960. Length is the runtime xsave_size, not the former constant sizeof(struct fp_regs)=1088. Allocation error skips memcpy and returns -ENOMEM.",
